Note, a file upload that is written to disk unchanged.
Note, start it, then open localhost 8091 in your browser.
Note, run this from the project folder so that the pages are found.

Define show form that takes request, do the following.
Read the file examples slash upload.html and store it in page.
Set content type to html.
Respond with the value of page.
End define.

Define handle upload that takes request, do the following.
Let data be the uploaded file avatar of request.
Write the value of data to the file uploaded avatar.
Respond with The file was saved.
End define.

Add route GET slash to show form.
Add route POST slash upload to handle upload.

Start a webserver on port 8091.
Say Open localhost 8091 in your browser.
Wait for connections.
